-.. math::
-    k(x_i, x_j) = \sigma^2 \Bigg(1 + \gamma \sqrt{3} d(x_i / l, x_j / l)\Bigg) \exp \Bigg(-\gamma \sqrt{3}d(x_i / l, x_j / l) \Bigg) \quad \quad \nu= \tfrac{3}{2}
