@@ -166,2 +28,0 @@ into a Hilbert space :math:`\mathcal{H}`, such that
-Where :math:`\langle \cdot, \cdot \rangle` denotes the inner product in the
-Hilbert space.
@@ -169,7 +29,0 @@ Hilbert space.
