-.. math::
@@ -489 +9,0 @@ defined as:
-   \texttt{balanced-accuracy}(y, \hat{y}, w) = \frac{1}{\sum{\hat{w}_i}} \sum_i 1(\hat{y}_i = y_i) \hat{w}_i
@@ -491,5 +10,0 @@ defined as:
