-    for an example of :func:`f1_score` usage to classify  text
-    documents.
-
-  * See :ref:`sphx_glr_auto_examples_model_selection_plot_grid_search_digits.py`
-    for an example of :func:`precision_score` and :func:`recall_score` usage
