-.. _wine_dataset:
-
-Wine recognition dataset
-------------------------
-
-**Data Set Characteristics:**
-
-    :Number of Instances: 178 (50 in each of three classes)
-    :Number of Attributes: 13 numeric, predictive attributes and the class
