-    ----------
-    coef_ : array, shape (n_features,)
-        Weights assigned to the features.
-
-    intercept_ : array, shape (1,)
-        The intercept term.
-
-    average_coef_ : array, shape (n_features,)
-        Averaged weights assigned to the features.
-
-    average_intercept_ : array, shape (1,)
